From 85c033051d4a64f710b49bdabf711ba241b7d221 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Cl=C3=A9ment=20Le=20Goffic?= <clement.legoffic@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Sep 2025 12:12:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: support ddrperfm on stm32mp257f-dk
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Configure DDRPERFM node on stm32mp257f-dk board.
Disable the node as DDRPERFM will produce an error message if it's clock
(shared with the DDRCTRL on STM32MP25x) is secured by common bootloaders.

Signed-off-by: Clément Le Goffic <clement.legoffic@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Clément Le Goffic <legoffic.clement@gmail.com>
Change-Id: I44fbc8079c3a077325074f79e95b0f9b79121261
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/571222
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Antonio Maria BORNEO <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Antonio Maria BORNEO <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
@@ -356,6 +356,11 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&ddrperfm {
+	memory-channel = <&lpddr_channel>;
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
 &dsi {
 	vdd-supply =  <&scmi_vddcore>;
 	vdda18-supply = <&scmi_v1v8>;
